ami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/alert(_:isPresented:presenting:actions:)-3c31d":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"alert","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"A","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV","text":"LocalizedStringKey","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isPresented","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","text":"Binding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"presenting","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actions","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text